{"id":53876,"mal_id":53876,"title":"Pokemon (2023)","englishTitle":"Pokémon Horizons: The Series","title_english":"Pokémon Horizons: The Series","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Pokémon: Liko to Roy no Tabidachi","Pocket Monsters: Liko to Roy no Tabidachi","Pokémon: Terapagos no Kagayaki","Pocket Monsters: Terapagos no Kagayaki","Pokemon Horizons: Liko and Roy's Departure","Pokemon Horizons: Terapagos' Gleam","Pokemon Mega Voltage"],"en":"Pokémon Horizons: The Series","ja":"ポケットモンスター(2023)"},"synopsis":"In a world filled with strange yet majestic creatures known as Pokémon, a new adventure begins! Hailing from the pristine region of Paldea, the timid Liko travels to the Kanto region to attend the Indigo Academy and become a Pokémon trainer—a person who forms relationships with Pokémon and trains them to participate in battles. Soon, Liko acquires Nyahoja, a fickle Grass-type cat Pokémon, as her first partner.\n\nPrior to Liko's transfer to Kanto, her grandmother gives her a uniquely patterned and gleaming pendant as a protective charm. However, an enigmatic organization—The Explorers—seems to know a secret about the pendant and nearly succeeds in stealing it from Liko. Fortunately, she is rescued by the Rising Volt Tacklers, a group of adventurers led by a Lizardon-riding trainer named Friede.\n\nAfter a series of encounters with The Explorers, Liko decides to join Friede's team, accompanying him and his crew members on a grand journey across the regions. Along the way, they aim to unravel not only the mysteries of the world of Pokémon, but also the power that resides within her pendant.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En un mundo lleno de extrañas pero majestuosas criaturas conocidas como Pokémon, ¡comienza una nueva aventura! Originario de la prístina región de Paldea, el tímido Liko viaja a la región de Kanto para asistir a la Academia Indigo y convertirse en entrenador Pokémon, una persona que establece relaciones con Pokémon y los entrena para participar en batallas. Pronto, Liko adquiere a Nyahoja, un Pokémon gato voluble de tipo Planta, como su primer compañero.\n\nAntes del traslado de Liko a Kanto, su abuela le regala un colgante brillante y con un diseño único como amuleto protector. Sin embargo, una enigmática organización, Los Exploradores, parece conocer un secreto sobre el colgante y casi logra robárselo a Liko. Afortunadamente, es rescatada por los Rising Volt Tacklers, un grupo de aventureros liderados por un entrenador de montar Lizardon llamado Friede.\n\nDespués de una serie de encuentros con Los Exploradores, Liko decide unirse al equipo de Friede y lo acompaña a él y a los miembros de su tripulación en un gran viaje a través de las regiones. En el camino, su objetivo es desentrañar no sólo los misterios del mundo Pokémon, sino también el poder que reside dentro de su colgante.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1470,"average_episode_duration":1470,"startDate":"2023-04-14","start_date":"2023-04-14","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"spring","year":2023,"start_season":{"year":2023,"season":"spring"},"episodes":null,"num_episodes":null,"score":7.38,"mean":7.38,"numListUsers":44170,"num_list_users":44170,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":2,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":4,"name":"Comedy"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":15,"name":"Kids"}],"studios":[{"id":28,"name":"OLM"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/d0axpGojOqDag5lDa0eNSEtw11l.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mYDlRCy9uvowwwyYWQbMj9HUKay.png","tmdb_id":"220150","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:49:30.114Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/137216.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/137216l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/137216.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime